<h2 id="how-to-use-web-search" class="group">How to use web search<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to clipboard" id="_R_4dtciav5ul5u9fmbtdpl4plb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-ghost-hover stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-ghost-hover "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h2>
<aside data-cds="Aside" data-prose-box="" data-icon-layout="first-line" role="note" class="flex items-start gap-xs rounded-card px-lg py-md font-sans text-body font-normal break-words bg-surface-1 layers-1-[color:var(--cds-banner-neutral-tint)] text-primary shadow-[inset_0_0_0_var(--cds-ring-inner)_var(--cds-banner-neutral-ring,var(--cds-ring-color)),0_0_0_var(--cds-ring-outer)_var(--cds-banner-neutral-ring,var(--cds-ring-color))] [--cds-prose-code-color:var(--cds-text-danger)] [--cds-prose-marker-color:var(--cds-text-secondary)] prose-block [.prose_&amp;]:text-prose print:break-inside-avoid print:[:is(h2,h3,h4)+&amp;]:break-after-avoid"><span class="flex min-h-[1lh] shrink-0 items-center"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:433.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p>Web search is enabled for your organization unless an administrator has disabled it in the <a href="/settings/capabilities">Claude Console</a>, where they can also restrict which domains it searches. If it&#x27;s disabled, a request that includes the tool fails with a 400 <code>invalid_request_error</code> that says web search is not enabled, rather than an <a href="#errors">error code</a> inside a search result.</p></div></aside>
<p>These organization-level settings in the Claude Console apply to Messages API requests only. <a href="/docs/en/managed-agents/overview">Claude Managed Agents</a> sessions use the per-tool <code>allowed_domains</code> and <code>blocked_domains</code> lists on the agent toolset instead; see <a href="/docs/en/managed-agents/tools-web-restrictions">Restrict web search and web fetch domains</a>. For a session in a cloud environment with <code>limited</code> networking, the environment&#x27;s <code>allowed_hosts</code> also applies to <code>web_search</code> and <code>web_fetch</code>; see <a href="/docs/en/managed-agents/environments#networking">Networking</a>. The per-tool lists restrict these tools further, within the hosts that <code>allowed_hosts</code> allows.</p>
<p>Provide the web search tool in your API request:</p>
