 Claude with the results. This process can repeat multiple times throughout a single request.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"5\",{\"children\":[\"At the end of its turn, Claude provides a final response with cited sources.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\ndc:[\"$\",\"$L12f\",\"28\",{\"level\":3,\"slug\":\"when-claude-searches\",\"children\":[\"When Claude searches\"]}]\ndd:[\"$\",\"p\",\"30\",{\"children\":[\"Claude searches when the request depends on information that is current, changing, or outside its training data:\"]}]\nde:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"32\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"Recent events, news, or announcements\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":[\"Current prices, rates, scores, or statistics\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"5\",{\"children\":[\"Information about specific organizations, people, or products that might have changed\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"7\",{\"children\":[\"Explicit requests to search or look something up\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\ndf:[\"$\",\"p\",\"34\",{\"children\":[\"Claude answers directly without searching when the request draws on stable knowledge:\"]}]\ne0:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"36\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"Established facts, math, science fundamentals, or coding concepts\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":[\"Creative writing or brainstorming\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"5\",{\"children\":[\"Analysis of content already provided in the conversation\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"7\",{\"children\":[\"Conversational turns and greetings\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\ne1:[\"$\",\"p\",\"38\",{\"children\":[\"Triggering is steerable through your system prompt: you can encourage Claude to search more readily or to prefer answering directly. For a hard constraint, use \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"max_uses\"]}],\" to cap the number of searches for each request.\"]}]\ne2:[\"$\",\"$L12f\",\"40\",{\"level\":3,\"slug\":\"dynamic-filtering\",\"children\":[\"Dynamic filtering\"]}]\ne3:[\"$\",\"p\",\"42\",{\"children\":[\"With basic web search, every search result is loaded into Claude's context window, and much of that content can be irrelevant to the request. With \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"web_search_20260209\"]}],\" or later, Claude instead writes and runs code that filters the results first, so only relevant content reaches the context window. This reduces token use on search-heavy requests.\"]}]\ne4:[\"$\",\"p\",\"44\",{\"children\":[\"Dynamic filtering runs web search from inside \",[\"$\",\"$Ld4\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/code-execution-tool\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"code execution\"]}],\": on \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"3\",{\"children\":[\"web_search_20260209\"]}],\" and later, the tool's \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"5\",{\"children\":[\"allowed_callers\"]}],\" field defaults to \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"7\",{\"children\":[\"[\\\"code_execution_20260120\\\"]\"]}],\", and when dynamic filtering runs, the API provisions the code execution it needs for the request automatically. You don't need to add the code execution tool to \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"9\",{\"children\":[\"tools\"]}],\" yourself. There are no additional charges for code execution calls made this way beyond the standard token costs.\"]}]\ne5:[\"$\",\"p\",\"46\",{\"children\":[\"To call web search directly, without dynamic filtering, set \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"allowed_callers: [\\\"direct\\\"]\"]}],\". Models that don't support programmatic tool calling require this setting. Without it, the API returns a 400 error that tells you to set it.\"]}]\ne6:[\"$\",\"$Ld3\",\"48\",{\"variant\":\"muted\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"prose-block [.prose_\u0026]:text-prose print:break-inside-avoid print:[:is(h2,h3,h4)+\u0026]:break-after-avoid\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"The web search tool (with and without dynamic filtering) is available on the Claude API, \",[\"$\",\"$Ld4\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-platform-on-aws\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"Claude Platform on AWS\"]}],\", and \",[\"$\",\"$Ld4\",\"3\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-in-microsoft-foundry\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"Microsoft Foundry\"]}],\". On Microsoft Foundry, deployments \",[\"$\",\"$Ld4\",\"5\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-in-microsoft-foundry#additional-features-not-supported-when-hosted-on-azure\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"hosted on Azure\"]}],\" support only the basic web search tool (\",[\"$\",\"code\",\"7\",{\"children\":[\"web_search_20250305\"]}],\", without dynamic filtering). Deployments hosted on Anthropic support all versions. On Google Cloud, only the basic web search tool (without dynamic filtering) is available. Web search is not available on Amazon Bedrock.\"]}]]}]\ne7:[\"$\",\"p\",\"50\",{\"children\":[\"The following examples use \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"web_search_20260318\"]}],\":\"]}]\n132:T10c4,\u003cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default dark-plus\" style=\"--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark:#f3f7f6;--shiki-light-bg:transparent;--shiki-dark-bg:transparent\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#953800;--shiki-dark:#DCDCAA\"\u003ecurl\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#CE9178\"\u003e https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#D7BA7D\"\u003e \\\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#569CD6\"\u003e  -H\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#CE9178\"\u003e \"x-api-key: \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#9CDCFE\"\u003e$ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#CE9178\"\u003e\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"-